@startuml component
title MyFirst2DGame — Component Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Player

package "main" {
  [Main\n(JFrame entry)] as mainc
  [GamePanel\n(JPanel + game loop)] as panel
  [CollisionChecker] as col
  [KeyHandler\n(KeyListener)] as keys
}
package "entity" {
  [Entity\n(world + sprite state)] as ent
  [Player extends Entity] as player
}
package "tile" {
  [TileManager\n(map loading + draw)] as tm
  [Tile] as tileC
}
package "world (PURE - unit-tested)" {
  [MapParser\n(text -> 2D array)] as parser
  [WorldGeometry\n(tile bounds, edge math)] as geo
}

cloud "resources\n(maps + sprites)" as res

Player --> keys : keystrokes
mainc --> panel : adds to JFrame
panel --> player : owns
panel --> tm : owns
panel --> col : checkTile(entity)
panel --> keys : reads
player --> ent : extends
tm --> tileC : owns Tile array
tm --> parser : parses res file
col --> geo : tileBoundsOf, movedEdgeIndex
parser --> res
tm --> res
player --> res : loads sprite PNGs

note bottom of parser
  Pure: throws IAE on shape errors.
  Tested without instantiating a JPanel.
end note

note bottom of geo
  Pure tile-math used by CollisionChecker.
  Extracted from the original CollisionChecker
  switch-on-direction.
end note
@enduml
